{"format":"hologram.registry.artifact/v1","id":"artifacthub/tinkerbell-community/syslinux","fetched":"2026-09-25T12:17:00.853Z","source":{"name":"Artifact Hub","api":"https://artifacthub.io/api/v1/packages/tbaction/tinkerbell-community/syslinux","page":"https://artifacthub.io/packages/tbaction/tinkerbell-community/syslinux"},"readme":"The below example will use the install the [syslinux](https://wiki.archlinux.org/index.php/syslinux) boot loader to a specified block device. The installation consists of installing an MBE to the first few sectors of the disk, then installing the boot loader on the FAT32 filesystem (on the specified partition).\n\n```\nactions:\n    - name: \"install syslinux to /dev/sda\"\n      image: quay.io/tinkerbell-actions/syslinux:v1.0.0\n      timeout: 90\n      environment:\n          DEST_DISK: /dev/sdb\n          DEST_PARTITION: /dev/sdb1\n          SYSLINUX_VERSION: 3.86\n```","readmeBase":"https://github.com/tinkerbell/actions","publisher":{"name":"Tinkerbell Community","url":"https://artifacthub.io/packages/search?org=tinkerbell-community","official":false,"verified":true,"cncf":false},"registered":null,"updated":"2021-03-01T12:41:45.000Z","categories":[],"keywords":["disk"," boot loader"],"license":"Apache-2","links":[{"name":"home","url":"https://github.com/tinkerbell/actions"},{"name":"website","url":"https://tinkerbell.org/"},{"name":"support","url":"https://github.com/tinkerbell/actions/issues"},{"name":"Tinkerbell Community repository","url":"https://github.com/tinkerbell/hub/actions"}],"maintainers":[],"stats":{"pulls":null,"stars":2,"subscriptions":0},"mediaTypes":[],"contentTypes":[],"storage":null,"tags":[{"name":"1.0.0","digest":null,"pushed":"2021-03-01T12:41:45.000Z","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":null,"status":null,"appVersion":"1.0.0"}],"tagsTotal":1,"security":{"low":0,"high":25,"medium":6,"unknown":0,"critical":3},"install":null,"version":"1.0.0","appVersion":"1.0.0","containersImages":["quay.io/tinkerbell-action